modules/Doomsday/mes/gamequestlog.mes:
{1000}{Tony Stark wants me to deliver a letter to his fiancee, Maria.}
{1001}{Maria Powell would like me to take Tony his ring, and to tell him she will always love him - even in the afterlife.}
{1002}{James Howlett has requested you deliver a note labeled 'CR Report' to Frank Castle.  He told you Frank has made camp to the far south, past the farm.}
{1003}{Frank Castle would be grateful if I can free James Howlett from the Latverian prison.}
{1004}{Frank Castle wants me to obtain a Vendigrothian Power Converter from the Latverian Fortress.}
{1005}{Sebastian Shaw said it is imperitive I retrieve a scroll that is key to summoning a being known as 'the nameless one'.}
{1006}{The man in the Torture Chamber cell is in desperate need of being released}
{1007}{Boris asked me to clear all of the wild boars out of his corn field.}
{1008}{Raven Darkholme is eager to get her hands on the Bow of Fire, which is owned by the Latverian Police Sergeant.}
{1009}{Sir Victor Von Doom wants me to kill the leader of the Technology Rebels, Frank Castle.}
{1010}{The Latverian Sergeant at Arms would like me to find Private Rosenburg in the Soldier Training grounds to the east of town.}
{1011}{The Fortress Guard wants me to bring him some Moonshine.}
{1012}{Sir Victor Von Doom wants me to kill the leader of the Inner Circle, Sebastian Shaw.}

